 "name_en": "Machine Learning for Monitoring of Goods and Invoice Receipts (2ZS)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Machine Learning for Monitoring of Goods and Invoice Receipts (2ZS)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A machine learning feature of the GR/IR application makes a prediction of the next status based on the history of processing goods and invoices received. The predictions are provided by a Machine Learning (ML) service that runs on the SAP Cloud. This communication scenario is related to the connection of the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> backend and the ML service. This scope item is deployed in conjunction with the Goods Receipt / Invoice Receipt monitor.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reconcile GR/IR accounts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor GR/IR account reconciliation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Predict the next status based on the history of processing goods and invoices received</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with the Monitoring of Goods and Invoice Receipts (2V7) scope item</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>收货和收发票监控的机器学习 (2ZS)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">收货/收发票应用程序的机器学习功能根据处理收货和收到的发票的历史记录预测下一状态。预测由在 SAP Cloud 上运行的机器学习 (ML) 服务提供。此通信场景与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 后端和 ML 服务的连接相关。此范围项目与收货/收发票监控器一起部署。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">统驭 GR/IR 科目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控 GR/IR 科目对账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio65b1fa9ec4ee4344a73b95838a873a3e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据处理货物和收到发票的历史记录，预测下一个状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与收货和收发票监控 (2V7) 范围项目集成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
